{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 54591,
	"Name": "Kenneth's Custom Shops - Halloween Style",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"AuthorLabel": "Kenneth",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]What is this?[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This pack gives your custom shops a spooky Halloween Style exterior. All buildings are dark wooden shops with jack-o-lantern pumpkins on the roofs, glowing orange lanterns, spider webs, ghosts, autumn leaves and vines, and cute Halloween details. Each shop has colorful striped awnings, chalkboard signs, and window displays with bread, cupcakes, drinks, fruits, and vegetables. Perfect for a spooky, cozy, and festive fall farm. No new items, no new content.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes Halloween Style for 10 shops:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Bakery[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Dessert Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Drink Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Fruit Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Grocery Store[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Seed Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Vegetable Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Fastfood Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Japanese Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]You do not need to download all 10. If you only use Bakery and Dessert Shop, download only those two.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]You must have the original shop mod installed. This skin pack alone will not work.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]What is inside each zip?[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Each zip contains one folder, for example Kenneth's Bakery, with:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• assets / KennethsBakery.png[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• content.json[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]How to use (Mobile and PC)[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]1. Download the original shop mod.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]2. Download the Halloween Style skin with the same name.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]3. Merge the skin folder into the original mod folder and overwrite when asked.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Only the building image and content.json will be replaced. Other files will stay.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Notes[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Visual change only. No gameplay changes.[/b][/size]",
